    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Diagnostics that break down the CPU cost of building a pushbuffer. Each test writes the same stream of single-DWORD NV097_NO_OPERATION methods, <computeroutput>load</computeroutput> DWORDs per frame, to a different destination or through a different path, so comparing their <computeroutput>submit_minus_reset_us</computeroutput> separates the cost of the memory being written, of the GPU consuming the commands, and of the pbkitplusplus Pushbuffer API.</para>
<para>These are not benchmarks, and are excluded from calibration. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
